    "created_at": "2025-06-12T08:24:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-12T08:25:23Z",
    "body": "I tested using reportSize and reportCount in HIDReportItem in both Window and Mac, it worked for me!~ Thank you for @nondebug @chengweih001  prompt support!~\nLet me close the issue\n\nFor others have similar question that come to this thread:\nAt the end, i used HIDReportItem. for my device's care, there are only one item for each report in Mac and two items in Windows, the first item described the data i need, and the second item is padding, So i can extract the data by checking reportCount * reportSize in first item",
    "author_association": "NONE",
